{"id":"ne_voa","lemma":"névoa","pos":"noun","rank":4532,"glosses":["mist, fog, haze"],"ipa":"/ˈnɛ.vwɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/ba/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-n%C3%A9voa.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-n%C3%A9voa.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"névoas"},"examples":[{"text":"Tom desapareceu na névoa.","en":"Tom disappeared into the fog.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to disappear","l":"desaparecer"},{"g":"in the"},null]},{"text":"A névoa está desaparecendo.","en":"The mist is clearing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/859147","words":[{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"is","l":"estar"},{"g":"to disappear","l":"desaparecer"}]},{"text":"Uma névoa pairava sobre o rio.","en":"A mist hung over the river.","words":[{"g":"a","l":"um"},null,null,{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"river"}]},{"text":"Tirando a névoa, não era possível ver nada.","en":"We could see nothing but fog.","words":[{"g":"to take","l":"tirar"},{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"possible"},{"g":"to see"},{"g":"nothing"}]},{"text":"Por causa da densa névoa, estava difícil ver a estrada.","en":"Because of the dense haze, the road was hard to see.","words":[{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"cause, reason"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"dense, thick","l":"denso"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"difficult"},{"g":"to see"},{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"road"}]}]}